msgctxt "88"
msgid "You the kid, huh? Gimme one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Um... here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"(That guy looked like some kind of host... Definitely not the\r\n"
"right age to be her boyfriend, at the very least.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Yo! Hit me up with that envelope!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Oh, right. Um... here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"(Well that was just your run-of-the-mill punk. Definitely\r\n"
"not boyfriend material, not to mention the right age.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Hey, kid. I'll take one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Right... Here you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "(No doubt about it. That guy was yakuza.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"(And decades too old to even think about being Haruka's\r\n"
"boyfriend...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Haruka? What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Oh, um... Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "What were you talking to all those men about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Oh, er... Just saying how nice the weather is! Nothing better\r\n"
"than a beautiful sunny day, haha! Anyway, I really should\r\n"
"get shopping now! It's almost dinnertime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Haruka, wait!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "(She has to be hiding something...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"(It's just about dinnertime, though, so she'll be heading\r\n"
"home any minute now. Guess I should do the same.)"
msgstr ""

